  "extraction": "Verbatim transcription of the published LaTeX table. No unit conversion, no derivation, no cross-table join.",
  "note": "Ettori+2019 X-COP (A&A 621, A39), Table 4 \"backward NFW\" hydrostatic mass results for the 12 X-COP clusters. These are HYDROSTATIC X-ray masses, NOT weak-lensing masses. Included because it is the only per-cluster table in the paper and is the anchor any later weak-lensing join would need. The paper's weak-lensing comparison (6 clusters) is reported ONLY as aggregate ratios; the per-cluster WL masses are not published here."
